---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../config';
---
<Layout title="Privacy — FoundNexa" description="How the FoundNexa website handles information, external resources, and email enquiries.">
<main id="main" class="container privacy"><span class="eyebrow">FoundNexa / Privacy</span><h1>A straightforward approach<br />to your privacy.</h1><p>This notice describes this version of the FoundNexa public website.</p><h2>Browsing this website</h2><p>This is a static information website. It has no accounts, contact forms, analytics tools, marketing trackers, or site-set cookies. We do not ask you to submit personal information through the website.</p><h2>Fonts and hosting</h2><p>Fonts and visual assets are served with the website. No third-party font service is contacted by this site.</p><p>When the website is deployed, its hosting provider may process technical request information to deliver the pages, including IP addresses and request times. Provider-specific logging and retention depend on the hosting service selected. This local version does not include a hosted data-processing or retention policy.</p><h2>Email enquiries</h2>{site.email ? <p>Contact links open your email application with a suggested subject. Sending an email shares your email address and anything you include with FoundNexa and the email providers involved. Include only information needed for your enquiry. Do not send confidential venture information or sensitive personal information in an initial message.</p> : <p>Contact details are currently being finalized, so email actions are unavailable. No messages can be submitted through this website. When configured, email links will open your own email application; they will not send a message automatically.</p>}<h2>Questions and updates</h2><p>This notice should be updated if the site’s features or providers change. {site.email ? <>For privacy questions, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Privacy%20enquiry`}>{site.email}</a>.</> : <>A public contact address will be added before launch. Until then, a privacy enquiry channel is not yet available.</>}</p><a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to FoundNexa</a></main>
</Layout>

